  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A continuous belt of width 0.60 m travels at a constant speed of 2.5 m s<sup>−1</sup>. The belt has a uniform distribution of charge of 5.0 mC m<sup>−2</sup> on its surface.</p>\n<p>As the belt passes a point all the charge is removed and is carried as a current in a wire.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the current in the wire?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">1.2 mA</li><li data-label=\"B\">7.5 mA</li><li data-label=\"C\">19 mA</li><li data-label=\"D\">21 mA</li></ol>"
  },
